name: sim.getShapeMesh
description: Retrieves a shape's mesh information
luaSynopsis: list vertices, list indices, list normals = sim.getShapeMesh(int shapeHandle)
pythonSynopsis: float[] vertices, int[] indices, float[] normals = sim.getShapeMesh(int shapeHandle)
inputs:
1. shapeHandle: handle of the shape. See sim.exportMesh for a usage example.
outputs:
1. vertices: array of vertices
2. indices: array of indices
3. normals: array of normals
